  "problem": "The distance between the points $A(5,-2,-3)$ and $B(2,2,-3)$ is{{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "The distance $d$ between two points $A({x}_{1},{y}_{1},{z}_{1})$ and $B({x}_{2},{y}_{2},{z}_{2})$ is given by\n\n$$\nd=\\sqrt{({x}_{2}-{x}_{1}{)}^{2}+({y}_{2}-{y}_{1}{)}^{2}+({z}_{2}-{z}_{1}{)}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $A{{(5,-2,-3)}_{\u23df}}_{\\text{(}{x}_{1}\\text{,\u00a0}{y}_{1}\\text{,\u00a0}{z}_{1}\\text{)}}$ and $B{{(2,2,-3)}_{\u23df}}_{\\text{(}{x}_{2}\\text{,\u00a0}{y}_{2}\\text{,\u00a0}{z}_{2}\\text{)}}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =\\sqrt{(2-5{)}^{2}+(2-(-2){)}^{2}+(-3-(-3){)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3{)}^{2}+{4}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+16+0} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25} \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
